{"sourceUrl":"https://ea.hfut.edu.cn/info/1081/4666.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:12.750184+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ea.hfut.edu.cn/info/1081/4666.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流与互动，加强有志于报考我院研究生的学生对学院人才培养和科学研究等方面的了解，合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院</span><span>将于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>-8</span><span>日<span>举办</span></span><span>“2025</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动，现诚挚邀请广大学子踊跃参加。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>有关安排通知如下：</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>一、申请资格</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请者应是</span><span>2026</span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生，并满足下列条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>拥护中国共产党领导、品德良好、遵纪守法、勤奋学习，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，思想政治表现优良；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>专业成绩排名和综合素质排名均在本专业名列前茅：本科前两年半加权成绩排名分别在前</span><span>50%(</span><span>双一流建设高校</span><span>)</span><span>、</span><span>15%<span>(</span></span><span>其他高校</span><span>)</span><span>；或有突出成果、高水平论文或特殊专长者（需在申请表的显著位置注明）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>对电气工程、自动化相关专业有浓厚兴趣，愿意从事学术研究；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>英语水平良好，通过国家四级考试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>二、申请程序</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1. </span><span>在线填写合肥工大电气学院</span><span>2025</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营报名信息表：</span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DWkpXc3h4UEpUc01q?templateId=25000&amp;create_type=2&amp;no_promotion=1#/fill</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>电子版报名材料提交：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院</span><span>2025</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表<strong>（需签字、加盖学校或院系公章）</strong>，见附件</span><span>1</span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）专家（副教授及以上职称）推荐信</span><span>1</span><span>封，模板见附件</span><span>2</span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）本科前两年半成绩单（需加盖学校</span><span>/</span><span>院教务部门或院系公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）身份证、学生证复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）大学英语四级成绩单及其他体现英语水平的证明复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）获奖证书复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>7</span><span>）其他附件材料，包括参与科研项目证明、学术论文等（较厚的出版物等只提供封面）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注：（</span><span>1</span><span>）电子版（扫描件）<strong>做成一个</strong></span><strong><span>PDF</span></strong><strong><span>文档</span></strong><span>发送到电子邮箱</span><span>hanpingping@hfut.edu.cn</span><span>，文件名称：<strong>姓名</strong></span><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>本科在读学校；</span></strong><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）邮件主题：</span><strong> </strong><strong><span>姓名</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>本科在读学校</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>夏令营</span></strong><span>；（</span><span>3</span><span>）报名截止时间：</span><strong><span>2025</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>29</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>24</span></strong><strong><span>点</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>纸质材料提交：<strong>被录取的营员在报到时，需现场递交报名材料的纸质版。</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注：纸质材料与电子版材料内容完全一致，要求统一使用</span><span>A4</span><span>纸，双面打印或复印。其中（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span><span>~</span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）为原件，（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span><span>~</span><span>（</span><span>7</span><span>）为复印件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. </span><span>出现以下情况之一，报名不予受理：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）未填写在线报名信息表；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）未发送邮件，并提供真实的证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）未按要求提供电子版报名材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>三、材料审核及录取</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>材料审核和录取工作由合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院负责，材料审核工作将于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日结束。夏令营录取名单将于</span><strong><span>7</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><span>在电气与自动化工程学院网站上公示，未公示同学为未录取，不另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>四、活动安排</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span>夏令营活动的日程拟安排如下，具体时间和活动安排详见入营报到时所发夏令营手册：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>8:30- 12:00 </span><span>入营报到、领取活动手册（合肥工业大学屯溪路校区逸夫楼</span><span>1009</span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>14:30-17:30  </span><span>开营仪式、学术报告、一级学科报告</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span><span> 9:00 -11:30  </span><span>综合面试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span><span>14:30-17:30  </span><span>实际操作、闭营</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>五、综合面试、实际操作考察要点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span>综合面试、实际操作主要考察营员的专业素质和综合素质。</span></p>\n<p><span>专业素质考察营员对本学科（专业）理论知识和应用技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，特别是考察营员对本专业基本知识和基本概念的掌握和理解程度、以及对本学科发展动态的了解情况和在本专业领域发展的潜力。</span></p>\n<p><span>综合素质考察营员思想政治素质、道德品质、诚信状况、个性心理特征以及本专业以外的学习、科研、社会实践、实际工作等方面的情况。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>六、优秀营员选拔</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span>在夏令营活动期间，按一级学科开展优秀营员的选拔工作，选拔环节包括申请材料评估、综合面试与实际操作考察。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>七、其他说明</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>本次夏令营不收取任何费用，食宿统一安排（合肥本地高校学生不安排住宿，外地高校学生安排</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日当天住宿），交通费自理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院将为入选营员统一购买在夏令营期间的意外伤害保险。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>营员必须遵守合肥工业大学的相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动，不得擅自离营。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span><span>请关注合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院（</span><span>http://ea.hfut.edu.cn/</span><span>）网站相关通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span><span>请大家妥善安排时间，你的随意会影响更想过来体验的同学失去机会！</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：黄老师</span><span>  0551-62901409 </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> </span><span>韩老师</span><span> 13865907748</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>EMAIL</span><span>：</span><span><a href=\"mailto:hanpingping@hfut.eud.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>hanpingping@hfut.edu.cn</span></a></span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"dcb0d76b7595b66965843b4c57fe80ceaf857a3a02ed0791fa068091953ff281","textLength":1818,"sourceSha256":"fa2722cce81795a97584e006019e8d320d0b71ac7f4381c9da8173624702da76","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院夏令营申请表.docx","url":"https://ea.hfut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1950742295&wbfileid=16449672"},{"name":"附件2 合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院夏令营专家推荐书.doc","url":"https://ea.hfut.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1950742295&wbfileid=16449673"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-9ab7f2b2bf6b8adf96ad","title":"2025年合肥工业大学电气与自动化工程学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:12.750184+00:00"}
